{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/12/16/6417811/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/12/16/6417811/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、我が家に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいか、若月、ゆったん、生駒ちゃん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか、まっつん、まいちゅん、さゆりんの、おなじみ犬メンが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集まって、犬会したよ～～(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事終わりにそれぞれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"買い出し行ったりして、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はお家で豆乳鍋つくって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってたのですが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとケーキも買ってきてくれてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日を祝ってくれました(；▽；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/12/16/6417811/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ～みんな大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいー(*⊃∀⊂*)犬メン最高！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他愛ない話で笑ってほんと楽しかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いすぎて苦しいくらい笑ったよ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う( 〃 ˆᴗˆ 〃 )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/12/16/6417811/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"華の94年組揃ったー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2016/12/16/6417811/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22歳初のお仕事は、このメンバーで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オールナイトニッポン！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったー楽しかったー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段なら完全に寝てる時間だけどみんなと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラジオしてるのが不思議な気持ちでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな訳で、私事ですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日22になりました～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日付が変わった瞬間、沢山の方から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連絡が届き本当に光栄でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログや755のコメントなども"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有難う～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22の自分がどう在るとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"数年後の誕生日、どこで誰とどうしてるとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなこと誰にもわからない訳だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんまり難しいこと考えず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この一年も自由に好きなこと好きにして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しんで、数年後もその時やりたい事を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってる自分で居れたらいいな～と思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーお腹すいた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr